     pands into a kernel module declaration with name ‘sys/_n_a_m_e’.

     The rest of the arguments expected by this macro are:

     _o_f_f_s_e_t      A pointer to an _i_n_t which saves the offset in _s_t_r_u_c_t _s_y_s_e_n_t
                 where the syscall is allocated.  If the location pointed to
